{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "tournament-engine-api",
    "name": "Tournament Engine API",
    "description": "Postman collection for the World Cup 2026 Tournament Engine backend.\n\n## Setup\n1. Import this collection into Postman.\n2. Ensure the API is running: `npm run start:dev`\n3. Default `baseUrl` is `http://localhost:3000`\n\n## Variables\nCollection variables are auto-populated when you run Create requests:\n- `tournamentId`\n- `teamId`\n- `groupId`\n- `matchId`\n- `accessToken` (after login)\n\n## Recommended flow\n1. Seed World Cup 2026\n2. Generate Tournament Group Stage Fixtures\n3. Get Group Fixtures → Schedule Match → Submit Match Result → Get Group Standings → Get Qualified Teams → Generate Round of 32 → Submit Knockout Results → Generate Next Round",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000"
    },
    {
      "key": "tournamentId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "teamId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "groupId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "matchId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (json.accessToken) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.accessToken);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"john.doe@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password1!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Authenticate and store accessToken in collection variables."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Tokens",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh-tokens",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "refresh-tokens"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
